T["Are you sure that you want to exchange 5 Skill Cards you have to Sealed Cards?\n\nHigher quality skill cards grant more Sealed Cards!\n\n|cffE73017You will recycle 5 random skill cards from your inventory when you press accept.|r"]="¿Seguro que quieres cambiar las 5 Skill Cards que tienes por Sealed Cards?\n\n¡Las cartas de habilidad de mayor calidad otorgan más Sealed Cards!\n\n|cffE73017Reciclarás 5 cartas de habilidad aleatorias de tu inventario al pulsar aceptar.|r"
