T["Restores 0 to 1% of your health per second for 24 sec.  Must remain seated while eating.  If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain Stamina and Spirit for 30 min."]="Restaura de 0 a 1% de tu salud por segundo durante 24 seg. Debes permanecer sentado mientras comes. Si pasas al menos 10 segundos comiendo, quedarás bien alimentado y ganarás Aguante y Espíritu durante 30 min."
