T["Timewalking quests are daily challenges take you back in time to relive classic adventures from World of Warcraft's past, offering great rewards upon successful completion."]="Las misiones de Cromie son desafíos diarios que te transportan al pasado para revivir aventuras clásicas de World of Warcraft, ofreciendo grandes recompensas al completarlas con éxito."
